Your skill in Hymns now improves your sight in darkness, increasing your infravision radius by [0, 1, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5)].

Also, when you end a Hymn, you will gain a buff of a type based on which Hymn you ended.

Hymn of Shadows increases your movement speed by [379%, 510%, 612%, 698%, 774% (TL1-5; SP 100)] for one turn.

Hymn of Detection makes you invisible (power [17, 23, 28, 31, 35 (TL1-5; SP 100)]) for [5, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5; SP 100)] turns.

Hymn of Perseverance grants a damage shield (power [313, 422, 506, 577, 641 (TL1-5; SP 100)]) for [5, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5; SP 100)] turns.
